<view class="page pantry"><view class="simple-title">家里常备哪些？</view><view class="simple-sub">选一次就记住，可省的调料不会影响推荐。</view><button class="secondary basics-button" bindtap="addBasics">我有油、盐、生抽</button><view class="ingredient-grid"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="ingredient {{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggleIngredient">{{item.name}}<text wx:if="{{item.selected}}" class="tag-check">✓</text></view></view><view class="local-note">已选 {{count}} 样 · 自动保存</view><button class="primary pantry-done" bindtap="done">选好了</button></view>
